# Boundary of the 2 damage: Bot2's Ornithopter (toughness 2) dies to the hard cast from Bot1's hand, and the card goes to the graveyard.
# Then Bot1 casts it again from the graveyard with harmonize {5}{R}{R} (CR 702.180a), tapping Ragavan (power 2) to take {2} off the
# generic part: {3}{R}{R} paid with two Mountains, Pearl, Jet and Sapphire (Ruby paid for the first cast) - seven mana would otherwise
# be needed and Bot1 has only six. The target, Immolation Shaman
# (toughness 3), survives with 2 damage marked, and the harmonize cast leaves the card in exile, not the graveyard.
# Negative control for the cost: Ragavan is tapped as the cost is paid.

